    But there's a second layer: Jin's fighting ability isn't simply the Devil Gene. His physical combat skills come from his Kazama upbringing, Heihachi's training, and later his own development as a martial artist.

    So, roughly:

    Jin's power =

        Devil Gene → supernatural power
